## Use multiple words

You can use the pipe operator `|` to filter with multiple words, like this:

::: {#7ae85d17 .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .filter(pl.col('manufacturer').str.contains('Mills|Purina'))
 )
```

